  message: "PREMISE CHECK 2026-09-30 (dev 134a06d505): CURRENT. Code unchanged, fixture reproduces both shapes, corpus count re-measured and matches.\nCODE: objc.py ~1051-1057 still reads: if receiver_name and receiver_name[0].isupper(): _module = receiver_name (NO guard); elif _declared is not None and _declared not in project_classes: _module = _declared. project_classes = class symbols minus categories (objc.py ~1319). objc.py commits since 09-09 (WI-somod 2dc35d7d3b, WI-bulaz, WI-mapor, two docstring audits) do not touch these lines.\nFIXTURE (scratch, survey, fresh cache): project class Foo; in -[Foo bar]: [Foo alloc] -> objc:Foo:0-0:alloc:external_symbol; [Foo log:@\"x\"] -> objc:Foo:0-0:log.:external_symbol; __auto_type q = [Foo shared]; [q zap] -> objc:__auto_type:0-0:zap:external_symbol (receiver_type_hint __auto_type). Control [NSString ...] -> objc:NSString (correct).\nCORPUS RE-COUNT (analyze_objc in-process on ~/whole_bunch_of_repos/{AFNetworking,CocoaLumberjack,fmdb,Mantle}; script + output ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/dryrun_09302026/C/objc_slots.{py,out}). Typed slot = calls edge to an unresolved dst whose module field is not 'external'; first-party = in the analyzer's own project_classes definition:\n  AFNetworking 1243 / 181 / 0 (14.6%); CocoaLumberjack 1371 / 309 / 89 (29.0%); fmdb 474 / 70 / 0 (14.8%); Mantle 212 / 23 / 0 (10.8%); TOTAL 3300 / 583 / 89 = 20.4%. Identical to the filing (FMDatabase 42 vs the filed 43).\nINSTRUMENT NOTE: counting every kind==class symbol (categories included) gives 847 first-party, because NSData/NSError/UIImageView categories mint class symbols; the re-count must use the category exclusion the emit-site guard uses.\nWORDING: 583+89 = 20.4% OF typed slots (measurement 0027 states 583 alone = 17.7%); the description's \"inflated by 20.4 points\" should read \"20.4% of the typed population is not an external module\".\nNot checked: whether io-boundaries / taint output on these repos changes with the guard (the item says the cost is disclosure, not a false match; not re-verified).\nRelated: WI-ziviv (re-kind 21 objc class methods: [Foo alloc] is a call on the type, still stamped call_construct=method in the fixture above), WI-marok (phase-2 module-slot migration), WI-koful."  # 602d
